# This directory should contain SSL certificates for HTTPS
# 
# Required files:
# - cert.pem (or fullchain.pem)
# - key.pem (or privkey.pem)
#
# For production:
#   Use a wildcard certificate for *.yourdomain.com
#   Or a certificate with SANs for app.yourdomain.com, api.yourdomain.com, pay.yourdomain.com
#
# For development:
#   Generate a self-signed certificate (see CERTS.md for instructions)

